    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "xilqt",
      "x": 1500,
      "y": 0,
      "name": "Lesson — why",
      "width": 440,
      "fill": "#1A1A1A",
      "layout": "vertical",
      "gap": 18,
      "padding": 28,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "EmxE7",
          "fill": "$g-text",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Why it's built this way",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$g-ui",
          "fontSize": 22,
          "fontWeight": "800"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "FVDai",
          "fill": "$g-text",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Read left, answer right",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$g-ui",
          "fontSize": 15.5,
          "fontWeight": "800"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "esQjP",
          "fill": "$g-text-2",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "The explanation never gets covered. You can reread the text while you answer, and your turn is always in the same spot.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$g-ui",
          "fontSize": 14.5,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "o8oIA",
          "fill": "$g-text",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Submit is the whole bottom edge",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$g-ui",
          "fontSize": 15.5,
          "fontWeight": "800"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "DtjzI",
          "fill": "$g-text-2",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "It's the biggest target on screen and always in the same place, so you hit it without aiming.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$g-ui",
          "fontSize": 14.5,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "J7qaL",
          "fill": "$g-text",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Picked answer turns solid white",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$g-ui",
          "fontSize": 15.5,
          "fontWeight": "800"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "MizEO",
          "fill": "$g-text-2",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "You can't miss which one you chose. The whole row is clickable, and the number is only a keyboard shortcut.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$g-ui",
          "fontSize": 14.5,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "jq8Oi",
          "fill": "$g-text",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Confidence is a rising meter",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$g-ui",
          "fontSize": 15.5,
          "fontWeight": "800"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "Zb8qf",
          "fill": "$g-text-2",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Five bars that get taller, from 1 (guessing) to 5 (certain), so 'how sure' reads as an amount at a glance. The word next to it says it in plain English.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$g-ui",
          "fontSize": 14.5,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "qyeil",
          "fill": "$g-text",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Plan as a step bar",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$g-ui",
          "fontSize": 15.5,
          "fontWeight": "800"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "r5sRi",
          "fill": "$g-text-2",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "The plan shows across the top as 14 small steps with the current one named. Click it for the full map. Before, it only appeared while a question was open.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$g-ui",
          "fontSize": 14.5,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "MSl8n",
          "fill": "$g-text",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Math looks like math",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$g-ui",
          "fontSize": 15.5,
          "fontWeight": "800"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "g8CAGs",
          "fill": "$g-text-2",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Stacked fractions, sums with their limits, italic variables, bold vectors, all in STIX Two (a font made for math). The lesson title uses it too, so headings match the equations.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$g-ui",
          "fontSize": 14.5,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "Z1tM8",
          "fill": "$g-text",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Text font: Atkinson Hyperlegible Next",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$g-ui",
          "fontSize": 15.5,
          "fontWeight": "800"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "vTjni",
          "fill": "$g-text-2",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Made for easy reading. I, l and 1 all look different, which matters next to math. Labels use normal sentence case, not small spaced-out capitals.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$g-ui",
          "fontSize": 14.5,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "taf8q",
          "fill": "$g-text",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Earlier answers stay readable",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$g-ui",
          "fontSize": 15.5,
          "fontWeight": "800"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "ybQtJ",
          "fill": "$g-text-2",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "A past check shows right or wrong, how sure you were, and a 'Why' toggle, all in one compact card.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$g-ui",
          "fontSize": 14.5,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "NQqiu",
          "fill": "$g-text",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Sidebar starts from the class",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$g-ui",
          "fontSize": 15.5,
          "fontWeight": "800"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "j2Jhz",
          "fill": "$g-text-2",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Class first, then its Overview, Graph and Files, then its lessons. The footer shows which agent is connected instead of costs.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$g-ui",
          "fontSize": 14.5,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    },
