          "content": "How much of the class have I covered? How did each lesson go? Can I trust my confidence? Each chart answers one, and nothing else is on the page.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$g-ui",
          "fontSize": 14.5,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "bmE9Q",
          "fill": "$g-text",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Coverage strip",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$g-ui",
          "fontSize": 15.5,
          "fontWeight": "800"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "i16To",
          "fill": "$g-text-2",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Every lecture is a block, in course order, and wider blocks have more facts. White means not studied yet. In studied lectures, the lighter part shows how many of its facts came up in lessons. Hover a block for its name and counts.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$g-ui",
          "fontSize": 14.5,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "PcG9x",
          "fill": "$g-text",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Next up picks the earliest gap",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$g-ui",
          "fontSize": 15.5,
          "fontWeight": "800"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "jUoSt",
          "fill": "$g-text-2",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Lecture 4 comes before 9 and 10, and later lectures build on it, so the one button is for that.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$g-ui",
          "fontSize": 14.5,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "DNfZe",
          "fill": "$g-text",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "One block per answer",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$g-ui",
          "fontSize": 15.5,
          "fontWeight": "800"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "S4zjMq",
          "fill": "$g-text-2",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "You can count right, wrong and didn't-know answers without reading numbers, and a lesson with lots of misses stands out.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$g-ui",
          "fontSize": 14.5,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "qMZA5",
          "fill": "$g-text",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Confidence chart",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$g-ui",
          "fontSize": 15.5,
          "fontWeight": "800"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "IcpxN",
          "fill": "$g-text-2",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "The white line is how often each level should be right (1 = 20% ... 5 = 100%). The bar is how often you actually were. Red marks the levels where you were overconfident, and the two 'sure but wrong' questions open in their lessons.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$g-ui",
          "fontSize": 14.5,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "k5Ofy",
          "fill": "$g-text",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Colorblind check",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$g-ui",
          "fontSize": 15.5,
          "fontWeight": "800"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "ByPLL",
          "fill": "$g-text-2",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Green and red were tested for red-green colorblindness and pass. They also always appear in the same order (right, then wrong), so color isn't the only cue.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$g-ui",
          "fontSize": 14.5,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "EGJJX",
          "fill": "$g-text",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Open question for you",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$g-ui",
          "fontSize": 15.5,
          "fontWeight": "800"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "C80vn",
          "fill": "$g-text-2",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "The lighter 'facts used in lessons' part needs the app to record which file facts a lesson used. I'll check the data before building it.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$g-ui",
          "fontSize": 14.5,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "frame",
      "id": "tIW0r",
      "x": 1500,
      "y": 2040,
      "name": "Graph — why",
      "width": 440,
      "fill": "#0F0F0F",
      "layout": "vertical",
      "gap": 16,
      "padding": 28,
      "children": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "AUVbp",
          "fill": "$g-text",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Why it's built this way",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$g-ui",
          "fontSize": 22,
          "fontWeight": "800"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "ozj7R",
          "fill": "$g-text",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Topics, not facts",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$g-ui",
          "fontSize": 15.5,
          "fontWeight": "800"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "VnN2L",
          "fill": "$g-text-2",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Each bubble is a topic (10–40 per class), so every one can have a readable name. The 200+ individual facts live inside their topic and show in the panel. Bigger bubble = more facts.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$g-ui",
          "fontSize": 14.5,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "dFQ4B",
          "fill": "$g-text",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Lines mean 'learn this first'",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$g-ui",
          "fontSize": 15.5,
          "fontWeight": "800"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "sZCQB",
          "fill": "$g-text-2",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "An arrow from A to B means B builds on A. Foundations sit on the left, advanced topics on the right. These links come from your lesson plans, which already record which steps depend on which.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$g-ui",
          "fontSize": 14.5,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "iZQhX",
          "fill": "$g-text",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Color = how you've done",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$g-ui",
          "fontSize": 15.5,
          "fontWeight": "800"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "k0jOtm",
          "fill": "$g-text-2",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Red is mostly wrong, green is mostly right, using the app's own confidence colors. Gray means not tested yet. 'Overconfident' marks topics where you picked 4 or 5 but were often wrong, the ones that feel learned but aren't.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$g-ui",
          "fontSize": 14.5,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "f5VGK",
          "fill": "$g-text",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Look up one idea",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$g-ui",
          "fontSize": 15.5,
          "fontWeight": "800"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "d11LD8",
          "fill": "$g-text-2",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Search finds topics and facts. Hovering a topic lights up its links and shows its score, what it needs and what it leads to. Clicking opens the panel: your answers as blocks, its links and its facts, each with its own right/wrong mark.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$g-ui",
          "fontSize": 14.5,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "jk8wo",
          "fill": "$g-text",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Still the look you liked",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$g-ui",
          "fontSize": 15.5,
          "fontWeight": "800"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "Bnmmo",
          "fill": "$g-text-2",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "The glowing dots, soft color halos and thin lines are kept. They now carry meaning instead of decoration.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$g-ui",
          "fontSize": 14.5,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "dB4w4",
          "fill": "$g-text",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "To check before building",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$g-ui",
          "fontSize": 15.5,
          "fontWeight": "800"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "Ikm6S",
          "fill": "$g-text-2",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Grouping facts into topics needs each fact tied to the plan step it was taught in. Facts already record the message they came from, so this should be possible, but I'll confirm it in the code.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$g-ui",
          "fontSize": 14.5,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "EoDgA",
          "fill": "$g-text",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Default panel: where you're at",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$g-ui",
          "fontSize": 15.5,
          "fontWeight": "800"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "dczYE",
          "fill": "$g-text-2",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "With nothing clicked, the panel is about your next exam: days left, one block per topic on it (strong, shaky, weak, not tested), and a short 'Work on next' list. Topics that aren't on the exam fade on the map.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$g-ui",
          "fontSize": 14.5,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "huu9C",
          "fill": "$g-text",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Work-on-next order",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$g-ui",
          "fontSize": 15.5,
          "fontWeight": "800"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "xDApk",
          "fill": "$g-text-2",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Topics other topics build on come first (Variance before Minibatch noise), then overconfident ones, then untested ones. One button practices them in that order.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$g-ui",
          "fontSize": 14.5,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "TQRpe",
          "fill": "$g-text",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "New data this needs",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$g-ui",
          "fontSize": 15.5,
          "fontWeight": "800"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "dcfjV",
          "fill": "$g-text-2",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "Each class needs its exams stored: a date and which lectures they cover. Your agent can fill that in from the syllabus. This is a new feature, so it's yours to approve.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$g-ui",
          "fontSize": 14.5,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    },
